  "limitation": "Fiat Ramp is granted for this credential and SELL quoting is live: real quote tokens with real pricing are returned for every listed network. Two independent things stop the external fiat leg from completing. First, the hosted widget requires an active A-Pass on the quoted chain (PRD 5.5) and refuses with RM_003; generate_apass is 403 for this credential (ASM-035), so no A-Pass can be provisioned on a ramp chain. Second, the listed markets are Transak-backed mainstream assets: neither the Monad settlement CVA nor the Base RWA CVA is a listed ramp asset, and Monad is not a ramp network at all. The on-chain OPERATOR_ASSISTED_OFFRAMP disposition moves the held units to a registered gateway account and is real. No fiat settlement is claimed."
